      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Returning to Chun Yuqiao's room, Bu Xiaogu tells him that Xingzi and Kaiwen stepped away from production and promises to stay right beside him—just as a red-alert rainstorm warning hits the control room. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
